This MIT license is the project default. It does NOT override the per-file
SPDX-License-Identifier headers, which take precedence:

  - Linux kernel drivers and patches ...... GPL-2.0-only
    (derivative works of Linux; this is a requirement, not a choice)
  - Device tree source ................... BSD-3-Clause
    (matching the convention of Qualcomm's DTS files upstream)
  - Debian/Ubuntu packaging ............... MIT
  - Scripts, configuration, documentation . MIT

The kernel sources, device tree and hardware-enablement patches in this
repository are derived from the postmarketOS port of the same device:

  https://github.com/agcarbajo/postmarketos-galaxy-tab-s9-ultra

They keep their original licences and authorship. Each imported file records
its provenance in kernel/PROVENANCE.md.

No proprietary Samsung or Qualcomm firmware is distributed with this
repository. Those blobs are staged from the device itself or from the official
Samsung firmware package by the scripts/stage-stock-*.sh helpers and remain
under their original, non-redistributable terms.
